&lt;h2&gt;OpenSSH bookmarks for local agents&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Connect agents through saved SSH aliases and copy new client tokens from a dedicated window.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use SSH aliases&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Grant access to bookmarks that use OpenSSH configuration. Save access again after changes to the resolved configuration.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Copy a client token&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Copy the token before closing the registration window. PromeFTP displays it once.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Read settings in your language&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Agent setup and bookmark actions have updated translations and aligned retention controls.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class="notice"&gt;Requires macOS 13 or later on Apple Silicon. Agent connections require trusted host keys.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/PROMLEE/promeftp/releases/tag/v1.1.2"&gt;Read the full release notes&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
